    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Breathe New Life into a Seaside Gem!\r\nIntroducing Roseville, an end of terrace, two storey, flat roof residence with a single storey annex, perfectly positioned in the heart of the beautiful seaside resort of Ballybunion.  Brimming with character and endless potential, this property presents an exciting opportunity for buyers looking to upgrade, refurbish, and create their dream coastal home.\r\n\r\nWhether you are seeking a permanent residence, a holiday retreat, or an investment project, Roseville is a blank canvas ready for its next chapter.  \r\nProperties with this much potential in such a highly sought-after coastal location rarely stay on the market for long. Viewing is highly advised to fully appreciate the scope of this property - To arrange a viewing, contact us today on 068 21739.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Breakdown:\r\n\r\nThe deceptively spacious layout provides great flexibility and comprises:\r\n\r\n•\tGround Floor:  Entrance hall, shower room, sitting room, living room, kitchen/dining area, and a versatile self-contained space.\r\n\r\n•\tFirst Floor: Four bedrooms and a second shower room.\r\n\r\nExterior & Special Features:\r\n\r\n•\tOutdoor Haven: A gated side entrance leads to a concrete yard and a long narrow garden framed by mature boundaries. It is the perfect, private sanctuary for relaxing on warm summer evenings.\r\n\r\n•\tUnbeatable Location: Situated in the vibrant East End, you are within immediate walking distance of Ballybunion’s town centre, local amenities, and world-famous sandy beaches.\r\n\r\n•\tGolfer’s Paradise: Located just a short drive from the prestigious, championship Ballybunion Golf Course."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 2.1m x 5.4m \r\nWith timber floor, electric storage heater and staircase to first floor level.\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.1m x 4.0m \r\nFitted carpet and large window overlooking street side.\r\n\r\nWet Room - 2.2m x 2.0m \r\nWith electric shower, toilet and wash basin.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.3m x 4.0m \r\nFitted carpet and solid fuel open fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area - 8.85m x 3.0m \r\nFitted kitchen, solid fuel range, side door access and large window overlooking garden. \r\n\r\nSelf Contained Unit - 7.0m x 4.0m \r\nFlat roof self-contained unit with three rooms with toilet/wash basin and galvanised corrugated roof.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nHalf Landing Shower Room - 2.0m x 1.3m \r\nWith toilet and wash basin.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor Landing & Corridor - 3.0m x 2.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 2.65m x 3.2m \r\nOverlooking the street side.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.8m x 3.1m \r\nOverlooking the front street side.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.2m x 3.2m \r\nWith fitted carpet - overlooking the rear garden and distant views of the Cashen river.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.0m x 4.2m \r\nFitted carpet and fitted sink - dual aspect commanding attractive countryside views from the east facing window. \n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "End of terrace, two storey flat roof house with flat roof two storey, single storey extension and a flat roof self-contained unit. \r\nGated side vehicle access leading to large mature garden capturing evening sunsets.\r\nLarge concrete yard and large rear garden.\r\nAll mains public services connected and electricity connected.\r\nSpacious streetside dwelling with small enclosed front garden with boundary wall and gated pedestrian access.\r\nImmediate walking distance to all services and amenities.\r\nThe property has moved on to the next phase of its journey and now requires refurbishment, upgrading of all services plumbing, wiring, heating, insulation, reconfiguring of layout and refurbishing."
      },
